docs.on:
- `List<T>` — an ordered collection allowing duplicates;
- `Set<T>` — an unordered collection without duplicates;
- `Map<K,V>` — an unordered mapping;
- iteration that affects the result MUST have a deterministic order;
- `sum` over Decimal/Money/Quantity is defined exactly;
- `average` requires explicit rounding/precision when the result is not exact.

